WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.404
Welcome to Inkwell, where every topic you study ends with something you can practise.

2
00:00:06.804 --> 00:00:15.602
Start in the course catalogue. Search for a topic, or filter by subject and by free or paid courses.

3
00:00:16.002 --> 00:00:23.850
Each course page shows exactly what is inside, and you can open the free preview lessons before you enrol.

4
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:31.824
Lessons are short and focused. The outline on the left shows where you are and what you have finished.

5
00:00:32.224 --> 00:00:42.082
In programming courses, code labs let you edit real H T M L, C S S and JavaScript and see the result straight away.

6
00:00:42.482 --> 00:00:53.055
After the lessons, practise with games, quizzes, self assessments and decision scenarios. Every score is checked on our server.

7
00:00:53.455 --> 00:01:03.153
Your dashboard brings it together: progress for each course, your recent results, and a learning streak for every day you study.

8
00:01:03.553 --> 00:01:11.911
Reach one hundred percent in a course and your certificate is ready to print. Create a free account to get started.

